WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.410
Key three: the guardian, on your own home server.

2
00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:06.973
It dies, or goes offline?

3
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:10.831
Your phone and hardware wallet still move any amount.

4
00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:14.459
Set up a new guardian, and move to a fresh wallet.

5
00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:15.896
Stolen?

6
00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:21.133
It locks itself after any restart. Useless to them.

7
00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:26.167
And it never held your money. Just one key of three.

8
00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:30.127
One key gone. Your bitcoin isn't.
